<title>THAILAND: RESEARCH ALERT - Fin One worth 4.2bht/share - Thaimex.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Fin One worth 4.2bht/share - Thaimex.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stock of Thailand's Finance One Plc is estimated to be worth just 4.27 baht per share, according to a research report issued by Thaimex Finance and Securities Plc on Friday.</p>
<p>Finance One, once the largest finance company in Thailand, merged with Thai Danu Bank Plc earlier this year when deposit withdrawals caused it liquidity problems.</p>
</text>
